<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Antibiotic Therapy</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Oral amoxicillin-clavulanate or metronidazole for acute gum infections. Topical antibiotics (minocycline gel) may be placed directly into gum pockets for localized periodontitis.</p></li>
