<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Periodontal Surgery</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">For advanced periodontitis — flap surgery to access and clean deep periodontal pockets, with bone grafting if bone has been lost. Reduces pocket depth and prevents further attachment loss.</p></li>
<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Gum Debridement</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">For necrotizing ulcerative gingivitis — urgent removal of dead gum tissue (pseudomembrane) under local anesthesia, combined with antibiotics. Provides rapid pain relief.</p></li>
</ul>
